for j in [1..#Mods] do
 G:=AbelianGroup([Mods[j]:i in [1..Nrows(CB[j])]]);cols:=[G![Integers()!CB[j][i,z]:i in [1..Nrows(CB[j])]]:z in [1..m]];
 Append(~CG,G);Append(~CC,cols);Append(~CH,sub<G|[cols[z]:z in cip]>);
